WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Control Center tutorial: Know where you stand and what to do next.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Page 1 of 3: Dashboard. Your start page: what is running, what needs you, what is next.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.610
The Dashboard is where every session starts: what is running, what needs you and what to do next.

4
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:14.110
“Needs you” lists what to fix, each with a button to the page where you fix it.

5
00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.532
Performance: spend, conversions and cost per result, as your ad platforms report them.

6
00:00:16.532 --> 00:00:24.419
Further down: running campaigns, automations, your marketing plan and your business context.

7
00:00:24.419 --> 00:00:27.019
Page 2 of 3: Marketing Plan. Your strategy as phases and tasks for the period you bought.

8
00:00:29.642 --> 00:00:34.942
The Marketing Plan turns your goal into phases and tasks for the period of your plan.

9
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:39.809
“Next task” tells you what to do now, and its button opens the tool where it is done.

10
00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:43.286
Every task says why it matters, what you need and what you will have when it is done.

11
00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:51.288
The index jumps to the strategy itself: audience, positioning, objectives, channels and campaign ideas.

12
00:00:51.288 --> 00:00:53.888
Page 3 of 3: Progress. Week-by-week progress, checked against what really exists.

13
00:00:56.498 --> 00:01:00.047
Progress follows your plan week by week, with the next task always at the top.

14
00:01:00.047 --> 00:01:03.682
Tasks OrivenAI can check tick off by themselves once the result exists. Opening a page doesn’t count.

15
00:01:03.682 --> 00:01:15.434
Only tasks OrivenAI can’t verify, like reviewing results, have a box to tick yourself.
